.* QUIHDWRSC: WRKHDWRSC and DSPHDWRSC, the hardware resources of one
.* type (RSCKIND names it in the title), each type's list as the oracle
.* lays it out; a resource under another is indented in RSCNAME by the
.* driver. DETAIL is option 7, CFGD option 5 (and 9 of storage).
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=KINDCL BASETYPE='CHAR 30'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=RSCCL BASETYPE='CHAR 14'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=RSC12CL BASETYPE='CHAR 12'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TYPECL BASETYPE='CHAR 4'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TMCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=STSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 20'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=SYSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 28'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXT22CL BASETYPE='CHAR 22'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXT14CL BASETYPE='CHAR 14'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 40'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=LOCCL BASETYPE='CHAR 60'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=LINECL BASETYPE='CHAR 76'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=PADCL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=RSCKIND CLASS=KINDCL.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=RSCNAME CLASS=RSCCL.
:VAR NAME=RSCNAM12 CLASS=RSC12CL.
:VAR NAME=RSCTYPE CLASS=TYPECL.
:VAR NAME=RSCTM CLASS=TMCL.
:VAR NAME=RSCSTS CLASS=STSCL.
:VAR NAME=RSCSYS CLASS=SYSCL.
:VAR NAME=RSCTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=RSCTXT22 CLASS=TEXT22CL.
:VAR NAME=RSCTXT14 CLASS=TEXT14CL.
:VAR NAME=DRSC CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DTEXT CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DTM CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DSERIAL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DPART CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DLOC CLASS=LOCCL.
:VAR NAME=DLINE CLASS=LINECL.
:VAR NAME=CFGPAD CLASS=PADCL.
:VAR NAME=CFGD CLASS=NAMECL.
:LISTDEF NAME=RSCS VARS='OPT RSCNAME RSCTYPE RSCSTS RSCTEXT'.
:LISTDEF NAME=RSCTMS VARS='OPT RSCNAME RSCTM RSCSTS RSCTXT22'.
:LISTDEF NAME=RSCCSA VARS='OPT RSCNAM12 RSCTM RSCSTS RSCSYS RSCTXT14'.
:LISTDEF NAME=DLINES VARS='DLINE'.
:LISTDEF NAME=CFGDS VARS='OPT CFGPAD CFGD'.
:KEYL NAME=WRKKEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F6 ACTION=PRINT.F6=Print
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
.* *CMN: the type alone, configuration descriptions and detail.
:PANEL NAME=HWCMN KEYL=WRKKEYS HELP=WRKHDWH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with &RSCKIND. Resources
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=RSCS SCROLL=YES.(No communication resources were found.)
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 105' HELP='HWCMN/OPTIONS'.5=Work with configuration descriptions
:LISTACT OPTION=7 ENTER='RETURN 107' HELP='HWCMN/OPTIONS'.7=Display resource detail
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='HWCMN/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCNAME'.Resource
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTYPE'.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCSTS'.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTEXT'.Text
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
.* *CRP: as *CMN.
:PANEL NAME=HWCRP KEYL=WRKKEYS HELP=WRKHDWH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with &RSCKIND. Resources
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=RSCS SCROLL=YES.(No cryptographic adapters were found on this system.)
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 105' HELP='HWCRP/OPTIONS'.5=Work with configuration descriptions
:LISTACT OPTION=7 ENTER='RETURN 107' HELP='HWCRP/OPTIONS'.7=Display resource detail
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='HWCRP/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCNAME'.Resource
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTYPE'.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCSTS'.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTEXT'.Text
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
.* *LWS: controller descriptions instead.
:PANEL NAME=HWLWS KEYL=WRKKEYS HELP=WRKHDWH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with &RSCKIND. Resources
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=RSCS SCROLL=YES.(No work station resources were found.)
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 105' HELP='HWLWS/OPTIONS'.5=Work with controller descriptions
:LISTACT OPTION=7 ENTER='RETURN 107' HELP='HWLWS/OPTIONS'.7=Display resource detail
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='HWLWS/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCNAME'.Resource
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTYPE'.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCSTS'.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTEXT'.Text
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
.* *STG: type and model, option 9 works with the resource.
:PANEL NAME=HWSTG KEYL=WRKKEYS HELP=WRKHDWH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with &RSCKIND. Resources
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=RSCTMS SCROLL=YES.(No storage resources were found.)
:LISTACT OPTION=7 ENTER='RETURN 107' HELP='HWSTG/OPTIONS'.7=Display resource detail
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ENTER='RETURN 109' HELP='HWSTG/OPTIONS'.9=Work with resource
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='HWSTG/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCNAME'.Resource
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTM USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTM'.Type-model
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCSTS'.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTXT22 USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTXT22'.Text
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
.* *PRC: as *STG, option 9 shows the attributes.
:PANEL NAME=HWPRC KEYL=WRKKEYS HELP=WRKHDWH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with &RSCKIND. Resources
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=RSCTMS SCROLL=YES.(No processor resources were found.)
:LISTACT OPTION=7 ENTER='RETURN 107' HELP='HWPRC/OPTIONS'.7=Display resource detail
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ENTER='RETURN 109' HELP='HWPRC/OPTIONS'.9=Work with resource attributes
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='HWPRC/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCNAME'.Resource
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTM USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTM'.Type-model
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCSTS'.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTXT22 USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTXT22'.Text
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
.* *CSA: the coupled system's name besides.
:PANEL NAME=HWCSA KEYL=WRKKEYS HELP=WRKHDWH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with &RSCKIND. Resources
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=RSCCSA SCROLL=YES.(No coupled system adapters were found on this system.)
:LISTACT OPTION=7 ENTER='RETURN 107' HELP='HWCSA/OPTIONS'.7=Display resource detail
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='HWCSA/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCNAM12 USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCNAM12'.Resource
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTM USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTM'.Type-model
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCSTS'.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCSYS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCSYS'.System
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTXT14 USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTXT14'.Text
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
.* Option 9 of *STG: the resource and those it drives (RSCKIND is its text).
:PANEL NAME=HWSUB KEYL=WRKKEYS HELP=WRKHDWH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with &RSCKIND. Resources
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=RSCTMS SCROLL=YES.(The resource is no longer there.)
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 105' HELP='HWSUB/OPTIONS'.5=Work with configuration descriptions
:LISTACT OPTION=7 ENTER='RETURN 107' HELP='HWSUB/OPTIONS'.7=Display resource detail
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='HWSUB/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCNAME'.Resource
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTM USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTM'.Type-model
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCSTS'.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTXT22 USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTXT22'.Text
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
.* DSPHDWRSC: the lists with the display options, as the V7R1M0 oracle
.* shows them (golden/verified/oracle71/panels/dsphdwrsc-*); *STG with
.* the type alone.
:PANEL NAME=DCMN KEYL=WRKKEYS HELP=DSPHDWH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Display &RSCKIND. Resources
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=RSCS SCROLL=YES.(No communication resources were found.)
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 105' HELP='DCMN/OPTIONS'.5=Display configuration descriptions
:LISTACT OPTION=7 ENTER='RETURN 107' HELP='DCMN/OPTIONS'.7=Display resource detail
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='DCMN/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCNAME'.Resource
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTYPE'.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCSTS'.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTEXT'.Text
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DCRP KEYL=WRKKEYS HELP=DSPHDWH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Display &RSCKIND. Resources
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=RSCS SCROLL=YES.(No cryptographic adapters were found on this system.)
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 105' HELP='DCRP/OPTIONS'.5=Display configuration descriptions
:LISTACT OPTION=7 ENTER='RETURN 107' HELP='DCRP/OPTIONS'.7=Display resource detail
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='DCRP/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCNAME'.Resource
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTYPE'.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCSTS'.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTEXT'.Text
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DLWS KEYL=WRKKEYS HELP=DSPHDWH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Display &RSCKIND. Resources
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=RSCS SCROLL=YES.(No work station resources were found.)
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 105' HELP='DLWS/OPTIONS'.5=Display controller descriptions
:LISTACT OPTION=7 ENTER='RETURN 107' HELP='DLWS/OPTIONS'.7=Display resource detail
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='DLWS/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCNAME'.Resource
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTYPE'.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCSTS'.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTEXT'.Text
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSTG KEYL=WRKKEYS HELP=DSPHDWH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Display &RSCKIND. Resources
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=RSCS SCROLL=YES.(No storage resources were found.)
:LISTACT OPTION=7 ENTER='RETURN 107' HELP='DSTG/OPTIONS'.7=Display resource detail
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ENTER='RETURN 109' HELP='DSTG/OPTIONS'.9=Display associated resources
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='DSTG/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCNAME'.Resource
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTYPE'.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCSTS'.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTEXT'.Text
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DPRC KEYL=WRKKEYS HELP=DSPHDWH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Display &RSCKIND. Resources
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=RSCTMS SCROLL=YES.(No processor resources were found.)
:LISTACT OPTION=7 ENTER='RETURN 107' HELP='DPRC/OPTIONS'.7=Display resource detail
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='DPRC/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCNAME'.Resource
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTM USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTM'.Type-model
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCSTS'.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTXT22 USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=23 HELP='FLD/RSCTXT22'.Text
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DCSA KEYL=WRKKEYS HELP=DSPHDWH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Display &RSCKIND. Resources
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=RSCCSA SCROLL=YES.(No coupled system adapters were found on this system.)
:LISTACT OPTION=7 ENTER='RETURN 107' HELP='DCSA/OPTIONS'.7=Display resource detail
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='DCSA/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCNAM12 USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCNAM12'.Resource
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTM USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTM'.Type-model
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCSTS'.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCSYS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCSYS'.System
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTXT14 USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTXT14'.Text
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
.* Option 7: the resource, its location, then its addresses and what
.* is attached to it in a scrolled area.
:PANEL NAME=DETAIL KEYL=WRKKEYS HELP=DETAILH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Resource Detail
:DATA DEPTH=10.
:DATACOL WIDTH=30.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=DRSC USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DRSC'.Resource name
:DATAI VAR=DTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DTEXT'.Text
:DATAI VAR=DTM USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DTM'.Type-model
:DATAI VAR=DSERIAL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DSERIAL'.Serial number
:DATAI VAR=DPART USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DPART'.Part number
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATACOL WIDTH=10.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=DLOC USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DLOC'.Location
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=DLINES SCROLL=YES.
:LISTCOL VAR=DLINE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DLINE'.
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
.* Option 5: the configuration descriptions that use the resource.
:PANEL NAME=CFGD KEYL=WRKKEYS HELP=CFGDH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with Configuration Descriptions
:DATA DEPTH=3.
:DATACOL WIDTH=30.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=DRSC USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DRSC'.Resource name
:DATAI VAR=DTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DTEXT'.Text
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=CFGDS SCROLL=YES.(No configuration descriptions)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='RETURN 101' HELP='CFGD/OPTIONS'.1=Create
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 105' HELP='CFGD/OPTIONS'.5=Work with description
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='RETURN 108' HELP='CFGD/OPTIONS'.8=Work with configuration status
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='CFGD/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=CFGPAD USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CFGPAD'.
:LISTCOL VAR=CFGD USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CFGD'.Description
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKHDWH.Work with Hardware Resources - Help
:P.The resources of one type the system found, each under the resource
it is attached to, with its type, whether it is working and what it
is. Type 7 for a resource's details; 5 or 9 for the configuration
descriptions that use it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPHDWH.Display Hardware Resources - Help
:P.The resources of one type the system found, each under the resource
it is attached to, with its type, whether it is working and what it
is.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DETAILH.Display Resource Detail - Help
:P.One resource: what it is, where it sits and the resources attached
to it. Page down for its addresses.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=CFGDH.Work with Configuration Descriptions - Help
:P.The line and device descriptions that name the resource. Type 5 to
work with one, 8 for its status, or 1 on the first row to create one.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F5 looks at the hardware again, F6 prints the list, F3 and F12
leave.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='HWCMN/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RSCNAME'.Resource
:P.The resource of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RSCTYPE'.Type
:P.The type of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RSCSTS'.Status
:P.The status of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RSCTEXT'.Text
:P.The text of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='HWCMN/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.5=Work with configuration descriptions
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to work with configuration
descriptions it.
:PT.7=Display resource detail
:PD.Type 7 next to an entry and press Enter to display resource detail
it.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='HWCRP/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
