:HELP NAME='FLD/DRSC'.Resource name
:P.The hardware resource name, as WRKHDWRSC shows it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DTEXT'.Text
:P.The text shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DTM'.Type-model
:P.The type-model shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DSERIAL'.Serial number
:P.The serial number shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DPART'.Part number
:P.The part number shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DLOC'.Location
:P.The location shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DLINE'.DLINE
:P.The DLINE of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CFGD/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CFGPAD'.CFGPAD
:P.The CFGPAD of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CFGD'.Description
:P.The description of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CFGD/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.1=Create
:PD.Type 1 next to an entry and press Enter to create it.
:PT.5=Work with description
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to work with description it.
:PT.8=Work with configuration status
:PD.Type 8 next to an entry and press Enter to work with configuration
status it.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
